          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoola siisa sia Wele, kumuleembe ne busiime mu bwichufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babekisia be bubeeyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaale base bakoosi, nakholanga kamaani khumuandikila kamakhuwa ke buonia nibwo khuli nabwo, nga ne neulila ndi nenyekha mbaandike ebarwa khangu khumutinyilisia enywe mu khupanila lisuubila nilio Wele aelesia khale babaandu bewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila babaandu balala bakhamanyile Wele tawe, baakhwichilemo mu bwikisi, babaandu bayuusia elomo eye kumwalaalo kwa Wele wefwe nio bachiililile khukhola ke sifwaabi ne khuloba Yesu Kristo, oli yeng'ene Omwami lundi Wele wefwe. Kamaandiko kang'oola khaale siiukuumo nisio bakhanyoole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
