            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khu Wele yeng'ene Omuonia wefwe, abe owe luyali, Omukali, Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne bunyali khubirira mu mwami wefwe Yesu Kristo khukhwama khaale ne naluno, nende buli lwoosi. Amina.",
